    "text": "Among the annoying challenges facing the middle class is one that will probably go unmentioned in the next presidential campaign: What happens when the robots come for their jobs?",
    "translation": "中产阶级面临的恼人挑战中，有一项在下届总统大选中可能完全不被提及：当机器人来抢夺他们的工作时，会发生什么？",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "介词短语提前引起的完全倒装句 + 定语从句 + 冒号同位阐释",
      "mainClause": "one is among the annoying challenges...",
      "modifiers": "Among the annoying challenges 为介词短语提前作表语，其后 facing the middle class 为现在分词短语作后置定语；is 为系动词；one 为主语；that 引导限制性定语从句修饰 one；冒号后为疑问句作同位语，包含 when 引导的时间状语从句。",
      "corePattern": "Among... is one that...（在……之中有一项……）；come for sth.（前来索取/掠夺某物）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
