      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "But many middle-class occupations — trucking, financial advice, software engineering — have aroused their interest, or soon will.",
    "translation": "但许多中产阶级职业——货车驾驶、财务咨询、软件工程——已经激起了它们的兴趣，或者很快就会激起。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "rebuilt",
      "sourceFile": "rebuilt_data/single_texts/text_2018_t1.json",
