    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P4-S2",
      "pIndex": 4
    },
    "text": "Curriculums — from grammar school to college — should evolve to focus less on memorizing facts and more on creativity and complex communication.",
    "translation": "从小学到大学的全部课程都应当进行变革，减少对死记硬背事实的关注，更多地聚焦于创造力和复杂沟通能力。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "简单句 + 双破折号插入语 + 不定式结果状语配对比结构",
      "mainClause": "Curriculums should evolve to focus...",
      "modifiers": "from grammar school to college 为介词短语作插入语修饰 Curriculums；to focus... 为不定式作目的/结果状语；less on... and more on... 为平行对比介词短语，作 focus 的宾语。",
      "corePattern": "evolve to do sth.（进化/演变以做到某事）；focus less on A and more on B（减少对A的关注，多关注B）。"
    },
