    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P4-S3",
      "pIndex": 4
    },
    "text": "Vocational schools should do a better job of fostering problem-solving skills and helping students work alongside robots.",
    "translation": "职业学校应该在培养解决问题能力以及帮助学生与机器人协同工作方面做得更好。",
