      "mainClause": "The challenge underlines the need: Starting new companies must be made easier.",
      "modifiers": "of coping with automation 为介词短语作 challenge 的后置定语；for the U.S. to revive its fading business dynamism 为动词不定式的复合结构修饰 need；冒号后 Starting new companies 为动名词作主语，must be made 为被动谓语，easier 为主语补足语。",
      "corePattern": "cope with（应对/处理）；underline the need for sb. to do sth.（凸显某人做某事的必要性）；fading dynamism（衰退的活力）。"
    },
