      "id": "P6-S2",
      "pIndex": 6
    },
    "text": "Taxes on low-wage labor need to be cut, and wage subsidies such as the earned income tax credit should be expanded: This would boost incomes, encourage work, reward companies for job creation, and reduce inequality.",
    "translation": "低薪劳动的税收需要削减，同时像劳动所得税抵免这样的工资补贴应当扩大：这将提高劳动者收入、鼓励就业、奖励创造岗位的企业，并减少贫富不平等。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "and连接的并列复合句 + 冒号引出的四重并列谓语结果句",
      "mainClause": "Taxes on low-wage labor need to be cut, and wage subsidies should be expanded...",
      "modifiers": "such as the earned income tax credit 为介词短语作 subsidies 的举例定语；冒号后 This 指代前面的减税增补政策，boost, encourage, reward, reduce 为四个并列谓语动词，for job creation 作原因状语修饰 reward。",
      "corePattern": "need to be done（需要被做）；reward sb. for sth.（因某事奖励某人）；reduce inequality（减少不平等）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
